oms, ceremonies, and beliefs between ordinary Muslims and Hindus. Such practices as the worship of the smallpox goddess Sitla were often practiced as ardently by Muslims as Hindus in the countryside.” .'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1582, 'temperature': 0.2})
