eremony of a neophyte, and in initiation songs sang by the goge, the local guitar players and singers usually invited on such occasions. [...] With the conquest of Fulani jihadists from 1804, bori spirits adopted Fulani names, making it possible for Fulani Muslim spirits to fit well into the cult."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1533, 'temperature': 0.2})
