y. In their edicts and ultimatums, Eternal Heaven (tenggeri), the supreme sky-deity that granted Chinggis Khan its blessing and the mandate of world-ruling, was translated as Deus, Allah, Khuda or Tian, depending on the audience.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1713, 'temperature': 0.2})
